{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8","type":"series","name":"Rangbaaz Phirse 2019 Season 02","description":"The series stars Jimmy Sheirgill, Gul Panag, Sharad Kelkar, Spruha Joshi, Harsh Chhaya and Sushant Singh. It is the story of a young guy who falls through the cracks of the society because of ulterior political agendas and is robbed of his youth which subsequently ruins his life. This season will be based on the story of Amarpal Singh, a feared gangster of Rajasthan. It will revolve around his journey into the world of crime. A product of caste supremacy and political rivalry, Amarpal Singh's story is an unusual tale of a dream gone so wrong that it couldn't be rectified after a point - a dream of excelling in every field, a dream of setting an example in the society, a dream of being the best ever.","releaseInfo":"2019","genres":["Hindi"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8.2.1","title":"Episode 1","season":2,"episode":1,"released":"2005-06-24T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8.2.2","title":"Episode 2","season":2,"episode":2,"released":"2005-06-25T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8.2.3","title":"Episode 3","season":2,"episode":3,"released":"2005-06-26T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8.2.4","title":"Episode 4","season":2,"episode":4,"released":"2005-06-27T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAxMS0yMDIwL1JhbmdiYWF6LVBoaXJzZS0yMDE5LVNlYXNvbi0wMi8.2.5","title":"Episode 5","season":2,"episode":5,"release